88340300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436200/extras/12b8f8676707b7bb755ee36cca599fad.mp4?t=1788340300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep automation and logistics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build dense assembly lines from belts, inserters and pipes, and cover long distances with cargo drones. Copy any working section of your factory as a blueprint and stamp it anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436200/extras/e09b1f685297b337cc89ca6241b8d0bb.poster.avif?t=1788340300\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436200/extras/e09b1f685297b337cc89ca6241b8d0bb.webm?t=1788340300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436200/extras/e09b1f685297b337cc89ca6241b8d0bb.mp4?t=1788340300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The nanobot swarm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You touch the world through a nanobot swarm. Point it at terrain to clear it, at resources to harvest them, at a blueprint to print it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436200/extras/4f16188d9d4d3095a3844f427ad08a6d.poster.avif?t=1788340300\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436200/extras/4f16188d9d4d3095a3844f427ad08a6d.webm?t=1788340300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436200/extras/4f16188d9d4d3095a3844f427ad08a6d.mp4?t=1788340300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your exhaust does not just disappear</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FluxWerks has no enemy factions, but the planet keeps score. Pollute the air heavily enough and something dormant in the soil might awaken...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436200/extras/12f61dcec7820540a6d7ec891449fef4.poster.avif?t=1788340300\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436200/extras/12f61dcec7820540a6d7ec891449fef4.webm?t=1788340300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436200/extras/12f61dcec7820540a6d7ec891449fef4.mp4?t=1788340300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a world with a past</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross deserts, jungles, tundra and volcanic wastes, and dig into cave systems. Scan for ore straight through solid rock. Points of interest are scattered across the world, with story background to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather wears things down</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain, blizzards, sandstorms and lightning cross the world on their own schedule, and machines wear out with exposure. Keeping repairs flowing is its own supply chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research across eras</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb from your first furnace to industrial chemistry and advanced electronics. Every research era asks for a noticeably bigger factory than the last, and each one unlocks machines that change how you build, not just how fast you build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The computing layer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced machines draw on a shared computing reserve produced by your computer clusters. A starved factory slows down, and computers draw real power and put out real heat, so datacenter management becomes a real puzzle to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for scale</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FluxWerks is designed for large factories, while still simulating the heat and fluids across the whole map. Fly freely around the world while the factory keeps running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The survey is waiting. <strong>Wishlist FluxWerks.</strong></h2>", "short_description": "Every block of this planet is real, including fluids! Dig it, flood it, process it. FluxWerks is a factory automation game on a fully destructible voxel world with physical fluid and heat simulation. Dig anywhere, automate everything, and survey a world that was supposed to be empty.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436200/3fecdbb0725f6a0c102d5ba924f58b91d4d0700b/header.jpg?t=1788340300", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436200/ed4318017bec7a941ad1cf8163472400b105db87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788340300", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436200/ed4318017bec7a941ad1cf8163472400b105db87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788340300", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core processor (e.g., Intel Core i5 / AMD Ryzen 5)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li